Revision history for Perl extension AliTV.

1.0.7 <2026-10-28>
 - CI moved from Travis CI to GitHub Actions (Perl 5.36, 5.38, 5.40)
 - Makefile.PL: repository metadata, license, minimum Perl version,
   complete list of prerequisites (Bio::FeatureIO is a separate
   distribution)
 - README: prominent warning that lowercase letters are treated as
   masked by lastz (Github issue #152)

1.0.6 <2017-06-28>
 - Default YAML file without the undocumented and unused output section. (Github issue #145)

1.0.5 <2017-06-26>
 - alitv script is now unit tested

1.0.4 <2017-06-22>
 - solves file name generation for given yml and project name (Github issue #90)

1.0.3 <2017-06-19>
 - add citation info

1.0.2 <2017-04-21>
 - tests for different BioPerl versions
 - improve documentation

1.0.1 <2017-04-20>
 - add alitv-filter.pl

1.0.0 <2017-04-13>
 - first stable release

0.1  Thu Sep  3 19:37:41 2015
 - original version; created by h2xs 1.23 with options
   -AXc --use-new-tests --skip-exporter --version=0.1 -b 5.10.0 -n AliTV

